      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THERMAL IGNITION (2) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing third (17.26) at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Likely to be in the finish again. CHEETAH MOON (4) was below best last time when eighth but three back was a Grade 5 winner in quick time at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. WANT SOME (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish a neck away in second (17.15) behind Soda Turkey at this track. Expected to feature. BUSTER BOURBSKI (8) warrants respect with the drop in distance.",
